      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-3c5a2f8cb7c7443cb8e7d1be14b4792a" textAlignment="1">
        <bounds x="180" y="12" width="325" height="109"/>
        <content>Best practice: for each value stream, define the value proposition and the primary value-receiving stakeholder.</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-d8b31ec9a06d4d629370304e5d964387" textAlignment="1">
        <bounds x="180" y="144" width="325" height="73"/>
        <content>Mainstream frameworks typically do not model capabilities and objects at this highest level. However, COVO establishes a fractal pattern, allowing for consistent zooming across levels.</content>
      </child>
    </element>
  </folder>
</archimate:model>
